=== REASONING ===
Design decisions:
1. Created CanonicalizeMap() operating on map[string]interface{} directly — ProcessSignals
   uses maps, not []NamedValue. Avoids unnecessary FromMap/WriteIntoMap round-trip.
2. Canonicalize() kept for single-signal lookups (useful for future callers).
3. Alias map is empty — zero behavior change, zero overhead (empty map range is a no-op).
4. Debug-level logging when alias is applied — observable but not noisy.
5. In-place map mutation (delete old key, insert canonical) — avoids allocation of new map.

